      "content": "That's a good start, definitely professional. Could you make it sound a little bit more \"human\" though? Maybe add a small sentence about how things can occasionally go wrong even with the best plans, just to make it feel less like a template and more like a real person is talking to them. I want them to feel like we're being extra transparent about the mistake.",
